{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"I found two gaps that affect the verdict. An idea card can quote a stored forecast even when its thesis bundle is omitted, and older stores contain revenue bands written only in words. I’ll check both against concrete examples and the release wording."}}
